  m_text: "When you use our app, make sure you are aware of your surroundings. You
    have some help along the game, the <u>exclamation mark</u> tells you how far
    is the next clue, the <u>professor</u> can help you with a hint for the next
    position. The <u>cat</u> will have the solution for you since cats know everything.
    \nEnjoy the stories in Malta!"
